g, or content parts only for per-question images), with no JSON-encoded form, so I agree the labelled parts should be rendered as prose.\n\nI have a local fix that renders the protocol's labelled parts (`background`, `goal`, `context`, `premise`, `question`, `option`, `yes`/`no`) as lines of prose in reading order, and drops the `field` label, which the question's `name` already carries. For example: `Triage a support ticket.\\nDoes this need a reply within the hour?`. Snapshots are updated; no docs describe the wire shape. One thing I couldn't do from here is the A/B on the labelled dev set (point 3).\n\nIf the direction looks right, could you assign this to me so I can open the PR?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-ai/issues/comments/6395171276/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"yftx293","id":198468199,"node_id":"U_kgDOC9RiZw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198468199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293","html_url":"https://github.com/yftx293","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yftx293/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]